{"3648520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duo Heli Combat", "steam_appid": 3648520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duo Heli Combat</strong> - explosive voxel helicopter action where you pilot a combat helicopter. Complete missions, capture bases and fight a friend on the same screen - co‑operatively or head‑to‑head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/62242a1ee053847a3ea48406aaee6f33.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/62242a1ee053847a3ea48406aaee6f33.webm?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/62242a1ee053847a3ea48406aaee6f33.mp4?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Missions and Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue prisoners, escort convoys, capture flags and command posts. Every mission demands pilot skill and tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e41eac7b13a49bffabb3bbf86e8997a7.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e41eac7b13a49bffabb3bbf86e8997a7.webm?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e41eac7b13a49bffabb3bbf86e8997a7.mp4?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bound by One Chain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique co‑op mechanic: two helicopters are connected by a fuel hose. Act in sync - seize fuel towers and topple fearsome walkers. Without tight teamwork, victory is impossible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/c5948b46032a7687bfbfff4fe4193c93.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/c5948b46032a7687bfbfff4fe4193c93.webm?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/c5948b46032a7687bfbfff4fe4193c93.mp4?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ecd837754d69cf1613b7e95b34841d19.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ecd837754d69cf1613b7e95b34841d19.webm?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ecd837754d69cf1613b7e95b34841d19.mp4?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Capture and Reinforcements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture enemy fuel towers and command centres. Call in reinforcements, expand your zone of control and grind down the enemy’s defences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/79cce83fc17d615fc379cd26135e0996.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/79cce83fc17d615fc379cd26135e0996.webm?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/79cce83fc17d615fc379cd26135e0996.mp4?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arsenal and Customisation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine gun, unguided rockets, homing missiles, bombs - unlock new weapons and assemble your own combat loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/9fb61a0c2e8d657412bd8130ada8eba9.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/9fb61a0c2e8d657412bd8130ada8eba9.webm?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/9fb61a0c2e8d657412bd8130ada8eba9.mp4?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/a063db9440e8f28570f79d5921ad914a.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/a063db9440e8f28570f79d5921ad914a.webm?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/a063db9440e8f28570f79d5921ad914a.mp4?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes for One and for Two on a Single PC</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign - play story missions solo or with a friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co‑op - special missions focused on team interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus - battle a friend: who is the best pilot?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer on one computer: play with keyboard and gamepad, or connect two gamepads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant voxel world with pixel aesthetics and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a pilot and a strategist - fly the helicopter and dictate the course of battle!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duo Heli Combat</strong> - explosive voxel helicopter action where you pilot a combat helicopter. Complete missions, capture bases and fight a friend on the same screen - co‑operatively or head‑to‑head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/62242a1ee053847a3ea48406aaee6f33.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/62242a1ee053847a3ea48406aaee6f33.webm?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/62242a1ee053847a3ea48406aaee6f33.mp4?t=1781724702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Missions and Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue prisoners, escort convoys, capture flags and command posts. Every mission demands pilot skill and tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e41eac7b13a49bffabb3bbf86e8997a7.poster.avif?t=1781724702\" width=780 h